# SPA fallback for static hosts (Render Static Sites, Netlify).
#
# Without this, refreshing or deep-linking /about asks the host for a file at
# that path, which does not exist, and the visitor gets the host's 404 instead
# of the React router. The 200 keeps the URL intact so the router still sees
# /about rather than a redirect to /.
#
# Vite copies public/ into dist/ verbatim, so this ships with the build.
# It is ignored when the Express server in backend/ serves the build itself —
# that path has its own fallback in backend/src/app.js.
/*    /index.html   200
